The kartenverkauf bounded context is located at:
backend/src/main/java/de/wps/ddd/kino/kartenverkauf/

When working on Kartenverkauf features, stay within this bounded context.

Structure:
- application/domain/entities/ - Domain entities (Saalplan, Vorstellung, Zahlungsvorgang, Kinokarte, Platz)
- application/domain/valueobjects/ - Value objects (VorstellungId, Geldbetrag, Film, Saal, etc.)
- application/domain/services/ - Domain services (Preisberechnung)
- application/domain/events/ - Domain events (ZahlungEingegangen, ZahlungAbgebrochen)
- application/domain/factories/ - Factories (KartenBlock)
- application/ports/primary/ - Inbound ports (Kartenverkauf, Zahlung)
- application/ports/secondary/ - Outbound ports (SaalplanStapel, AktuelleVorstellungen, Zahlungsvorgaenge)
- application/services/ - Application services (KartenverkaufImpl, ZahlungImpl)
- adapters/primary/web/ - REST controllers, DTOs, and mappers
- adapters/secondary/persistence/ - JPA repositories, entities, and mappers